    "detailed_description": "<strong>LABWATCH</strong> is an atmospheric horror strategy game where you must make sure every machine is working while avoiding dangerous enemies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Observe!</h2>Look through cameras to find out which machines needs repairing and to find out the places you should avoid.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640760/extras/c6a6b90e9a904479cd6489b1d8c0fb37.poster.avif?t=1698583096\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640760/extras/c6a6b90e9a904479cd6489b1d8c0fb37.webm?t=1698583096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640760/extras/c6a6b90e9a904479cd6489b1d8c0fb37.mp4?t=1698583096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tread Carefully!</h2>To repair machines you yourself must venture out to fix them manually. Remember to restart your generator before going out and try to repair the machine before your generator breaks down!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640760/extras/a47dda65bccf0bb0a963af5cc4e8a10a.poster.avif?t=1698583096\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640760/extras/a47dda65bccf0bb0a963af5cc4e8a10a.webm?t=1698583096\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2640760/extras/a47dda65bccf0bb0a963af5cc4e8a10a.mp4?t=1698583096\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive!</h2>While venturing out to repair machines, you may encounter dangerous enemies. Try your best to survive all 3 nights without dying.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cl